[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0010","text":"辛苦了……\n制作人大人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0020","text":"哦，辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0030","text":"……那个……\n稍等一下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0040","text":"——给\n这是凛世的那份"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0050","text":"……这就是……\n和２８３事务所的大家……一样的衣装……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0060","text":"非常……\n非常……漂亮……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0070","text":"哈哈\n你喜欢就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0080","text":"虽然有点突然，\n能试穿一下吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0090","text":"好的……\n那么……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_01_0100","text":"请……稍等片刻……\n制作人大人……"}]
